# Cursor MCP Configuration for Figma Integration

## MCP Tools
- figma: Connect to Figma desktop app for design operations

## Figma MCP Settings
- Enable Figma desktop app connection
- Allow design reading and modification
- Support for prototype creation and UI generation

## Usage Guidelines
- Use Figma MCP for creating prototype diagrams
- Generate UI code from Figma designs
- Create design system components
- Export design assets and specifications












